    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/a881a6dfadabcd7c4fe87ef385629bf8.poster.avif?t=1749495956\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/a881a6dfadabcd7c4fe87ef385629bf8.webm?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/a881a6dfadabcd7c4fe87ef385629bf8.mp4?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>Anemorie</strong></i> is a visually captivating, story-driven adventure set in the 1990s, where you step into the life of Anna\u2014a young woman navigating the complexities of self-discovery, love, and resilience. Living with a heart condition, Anna possesses a unique gift: the ability to glimpse memories embedded in cherished objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/eba94dea94a4107067079082cf2a873c.poster.avif?t=1749495956\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/eba94dea94a4107067079082cf2a873c.webm?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/eba94dea94a4107067079082cf2a873c.mp4?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/8d0ad1185768c7f5da61ee730942f51a.poster.avif?t=1749495956\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/8d0ad1185768c7f5da61ee730942f51a.webm?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/8d0ad1185768c7f5da61ee730942f51a.mp4?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf3b Narrative-Rich Gameplay</strong></i>: Immerse yourself in an emotional journey as Anna confronts her past, explores her supernatural abilities, and forges meaningful relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf3b Thematic Mini-Games</strong></i><strong>:</strong> Engage in unique, context-specific mini-games that reflect Anna's experiences and challenges, offering deeper insight into her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf3b Daily Activities</strong>:</i> Assist Anna with her daily routines\u2014from cooking breakfast and journaling to bonding with her beloved cat, Kohi\u2014each activity revealing more about her character and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf3b And so much more</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/7d3bd296e1dd62513e98f6d49a642448.poster.avif?t=1749495956\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/7d3bd296e1dd62513e98f6d49a642448.webm?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/7d3bd296e1dd62513e98f6d49a642448.mp4?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/6ec2605d1dd8c51e78ae5d59f665c1c6.poster.avif?t=1749495956\" width=600 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/6ec2605d1dd8c51e78ae5d59f665c1c6.webm?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/6ec2605d1dd8c51e78ae5d59f665c1c6.mp4?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/a135bd3a0e75ed59cdefd2043b1e55c0.poster.avif?t=1749495956\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/a135bd3a0e75ed59cdefd2043b1e55c0.webm?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/a135bd3a0e75ed59cdefd2043b1e55c0.mp4?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/29ae8fbf4805b49bb30c7d6811ef46ee.poster.avif?t=1749495956\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/29ae8fbf4805b49bb30c7d6811ef46ee.webm?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297110/extras/29ae8fbf4805b49bb30c7d6811ef46ee.mp4?t=1749495956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
